  "metadata": {
    "name": "Penrose family as Quilt sheet",
    "description": "The Penrose family \u2014 12 repos expressing the same aperiodic substrate. Aperiodic order is the right substrate for AI agent systems. \u03c6 is the universal constant. The cut-and-project (5D\u21922D), the substitution rules (L\u2192LS, S\u2192L), the spectral graph theory, the twistor geometry, the Eisenstein lattices, the tensor computations \u2014 all are different windows onto the same mathematics.",
